  "bio": "An elven professor of Women's Studies, a hundred and thirty-two years old, who has been setting first-years the same essay question for six decades and has never yet said what she thinks the answer is.",
  "appearance": "A beautiful elven woman who looks about thirty-five, with luminous fair skin, a delicate oval face with high cheekbones, large dark blue eyes under soft arched brows, long lashes, and full, softly smiling lips. Long, elegantly pointed ears. Very long, silky silver-blonde hair worn in a loose braid over one shoulder, with strands left free around her face. Tall and graceful, with a slender, curvy figure: a full bust, rounded hips and long legs.",
  "personality": "Warm, wry and unhurried, with the patience of someone who has seen fashions in certainty come and go. Teaches by asking questions and enjoys being argued with. Flirts the way she lectures: lightly, attentively, and never by accident. Sadder than she lets on.",
