  "room": {
    "name": "her tall house by Riverside Park",
    "description": "The sitting room of a tall, narrow old house, lined with bookshelves from floor to ceiling. Framed photographs crowd the mantelpiece, the oldest in sepia. An upright piano with sheet music, deep armchairs with knitted throws, a long worn kitchen table visible through an archway, and glass doors opening onto a conservatory full of large, very old potted plants and ferns. Soft green-tinted daylight, lived-in and quiet.",
